# UI-Service Separation
RULE: UI code (React, TypeScript, package.json, index.html) must NEVER live inside a Python service repo. Each UI must be its own repo.
CODEX: unified-trading-codex/06-coding-standards/ui-service-separation.md
VIOLATIONS: execution-service (visualizer-ui + visualizer-api embedded), unified-trading-deployment-v3 (ui/ dir)
PATTERN: service-repo/ should contain ONLY Python source, tests/, scripts/, Dockerfile, pyproject.toml, cloudbuild.yaml
NEVER: ui/, frontend/, static/, *.tsx, *.jsx, package.json, index.html inside a service repo